 "description": "Pritchard2014 - plant-microbe interaction\nBioModels BIOMD0000000563 (curated). SBML file: BIOMD0000000563_url.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 100 time units (SED-ML: BIOMD0000000563_url.sedml (auto-generated placeholder); duration chosen from the dynamics: no dynamics; extended past the last time event (10)), sampling 0.1.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 1.91e-06 of species peak (worst: E)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] Effector_translocation: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] time event(s) on 'Path_bulk' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_PATH_BULK.TXT (SET)\nRenamed species (Kintecus name = SBML id): R1 = R; E1 = E",
